    <h1>AI Text Watermarking, <em>Explained</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">In August 2026 Anthropic began hiding a mark inside everything Claude writes, worldwide, with no way to switch it off. Google has done the same to Gemini since 2024. Here is what the marks actually are, what survives a copy and paste, who can read them, and what any of it asks of an ordinary business.</p>
